Existing in-binary tests (lines 659-812) show canonical CLI parse shapes for `onboard propose/approve`, `backlog metadata-check`, `backlog complete`/`record-complete`, and the `--prd` repeatable-flag parsing test `drive_accepts_repeatable_prd_allowlist_flags`.

